    {
     "type": "html",
     "title": "What is installed in FOS today",
     "icon": "plug",
     "sub": "Taken from the live AppSuite page: 9 ERP plugins and the Filament pieces behind the iframe views.",
     "html": "<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Kind</th><th>Screen today</th><th>Replaced by</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>accounts</b></td><td>ERP plugin</td><td>Own menu pages and menu manager, shown in an iframe (<a href=\"admin/modules\">AppSuite</a>)</td><td>Commerce: invoices, payments, expenses</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>employees</b></td><td>ERP plugin</td><td>Own menu pages and menu manager, shown in an iframe (<a href=\"admin/modules\">AppSuite</a>)</td><td>Contact Control Center: staff and users</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>inventories</b></td><td>ERP plugin</td><td>Own menu pages and menu manager, shown in an iframe (<a href=\"admin/modules\">AppSuite</a>)</td><td>Procurement and Commerce: Warehouse, receiving</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>invoices</b></td><td>ERP plugin</td><td>Own menu pages and menu manager, shown in an iframe (<a href=\"admin/modules\">AppSuite</a>)</td><td>Commerce: invoices</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>maintenance</b></td><td>ERP plugin</td><td>Own menu pages and menu manager, shown in an iframe (<a href=\"admin/modules\">AppSuite</a>)</td><td>No PRD page yet (decide: drop or keep)</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>manufacturing</b></td><td>ERP plugin</td><td>Own menu pages and menu manager, shown in an iframe (<a href=\"admin/modules\">AppSuite</a>)</td><td>No PRD page yet (decide: drop or keep)</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>products</b></td><td>ERP plugin</td><td>Own menu pages and menu manager, shown in an iframe (<a href=\"admin/modules\">AppSuite</a>)</td><td>FOS Core: products and services (native)</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>purchases</b></td><td>ERP plugin</td><td>Own menu pages and menu manager, shown in an iframe (<a href=\"admin/modules\">AppSuite</a>)</td><td>Commerce: RFQs and purchase orders</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>sales</b></td><td>ERP plugin</td><td>Own menu pages and menu manager, shown in an iframe (<a href=\"admin/modules\">AppSuite</a>)</td><td>CRM product (separate)</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spatie Media Library (Filament plugin)</b></td><td>Filament plugin</td><td>Filament screen</td><td>FOS Core media (native uploader)</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>Composer installer</b></td><td>Filament page</td><td>Filament screen</td><td>AppSuite Install tab</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>Plugin playground</b></td><td>Filament page</td><td>Filament screen</td><td>Removed (test surface only)</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr><tr><td><b>Reference library, Create catalog item</b></td><td>Filament pages</td><td>Filament screen</td><td>FOS Core products and services</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-orange\">To replace</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px\">The native Laravel modules (Core Entities, Products, Services, Audit Log, Custom Fields, Socialite, AI Data Copilot, Contact Control Center, VendorOS) stay. Everything above is replaced by the HTML design ported into FOS, then removed. Nothing is removed until the replacement page works and FOS owns the data.</p>"
    }
